$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Fantazmal Alpha" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Bland (same as everyday due to lack of proper atmosphere)" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> You just woke up" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> again find themselves terraforming the same planet. Seeing that co-existance is not only lame, but not possible, each nation has agreed to a battle of teams to decide who wins the rights to the planet. Each team must capture the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base. Air power is helpful, but retaining control of your Forward Bases is a MUST!  The first team with 5 captures shall be the victor, and retain control of the planet Fantazmal!";
